[2026-10-28T01:14:05+08:00] INSERT INTO chunks (doc_id, project, kind, rel_path, symbol, title, line_start, line_end, content, content_hash, updated_at) VALUES (%s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s, %s)  -- params=["35", "minimart", "spec", "specs/REQ-001-order-query.md", "REQ-001.2 金额下限（闭区间）", "REQ-001.2 金额下限（闭区间）", "13", "17", "## REQ-001.2 金额下限（闭区间）\n\n`list_orders(min_total=...)` 可选参数，单位为分（整数），表示订单金额下限，比较使用闭区间（`total_cents >= min_total`）。\n传入 `None` 或 `0` 表示不按金额筛选。传入负数必须抛出 `ValidationEr", "f55d8e8bc49d5f990e9e52a824904216e29649f2e2f2e066d18215ac25c404f6", "2026-10-28 01:14:05"]
